# Type HELLO locally, command sync broadcasts original buffer, then add one local character.
at 100 text HELLO
at 200 key LSHIFT down
at 201 key PERIOD down
at 202 key PERIOD up
at 203 key LSHIFT up
at 210 text sync
at 240 key ENTER down
at 241 key ENTER up
at 500 text A
at 1400 key ESC down
at 1401 key ESC up
